@startuml uc002-analysis-sequence
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-002 Prepare benchmark dataset: analysis sequence (main success scenario)

control "Prepare Benchmark" as Prep
boundary "Benchmark File Reader" as BFR
entity "Problem List" as PL
entity "Test Case" as TC
entity "Benchmark" as B

[-> Prep : load(path)
Prep -> BFR : read text(path)
BFR --> Prep : file content
Prep -> Prep : parse content as JSON
Prep -> Prep : check benchmark id, name,\nand that cases is a non-empty list
loop for each case, in file order
  Prep -> Prep : check it is an object with three\nnon-empty text fields and no others
  Prep -> TC : create(id, question, expected answer)
  Prep -> Prep : check the id is not used by an earlier case
end
Prep -> PL : any problems?
PL --> Prep : none
Prep -> B : create(id, name, test cases in file order)
[<-- Prep : benchmark

note right of PL
  Extensions 3a, 3b, 4a to 4d: each broken rule
  adds a problem with its location, and checking
  goes on. At the end, any problem means a
  Benchmark Error listing them all, and no Benchmark.
end note
@enduml
